```css
/* mobile-first: base styles for narrow, then enhance */
.nav__list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
@media (min-width: 46rem) {             /* where 6 links fit in one row */
  .nav__list { flex-direction: row; }
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root { --color-bg: #111827; --color-text: #f3f4f6; }
}
@media (prefers-contrast: more) {
  :root { --color-border: #000; }
}
@supports (container-type: inline-size) {
  .panel { container-type: inline-size; }
}
```

| Query | Responds to |
|---|---|
| `(min-width: 46rem)`. | viewport width (in rem, so text zoom counts). |
| `prefers-color-scheme`. | the user's light/dark setting. |
| `prefers-contrast`. | the user's request for more contrast. |
| `@supports`. | whether the browser supports a feature. |

